{"id":"e1cdd4c4623e324f","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-m-complete-creative.md","title":"M-Complete Implies Creative","display":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-m-complete-creative","aliases":["92-thm-m-complete-creative"],"display":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative","depends_on":["[[92-df-m-complete]]","[[92-df-creative-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-m-complete-creative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-m-complete-creative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-m-complete-creative — M-Complete Implies Creative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\)</span> (m-complete, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" href=\"?note=9f063fb5c2ee3d66\" title=\"92-df-m-complete\">92-df-m-complete</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}\\)</span> (creative-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9d6396579de4ff0\" href=\"?note=c9d6396579de4ff0\" title=\"92-df-creative-set\">92-df-creative-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多一完全r.e.集是创造集</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>设<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>多一完全，所有r.e.集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m A\">\\(\\leq_m A\\)</span></li>\n<li>利用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的多一完备性，把任意候选枚举集统一归约到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span></li>\n<li>再用参数定理与递归定理把该归约自指化，得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\)</span>的生产力函数</li>\n<li>多一归约通常没有可计算逆，证明不能使用原先写出的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}\">\\(f^{-1}\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>逆命题也成立：在固定可接受编号下，c.e.集创造当且仅当多一完全；本原子只陈述所标明的正向蕴涵</li>\n<li>标准停机集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>是创造集；某个理论的定理码集是否创造，取决于该理论的有效性、表达能力与一致性等附加条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-m-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-creative-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-m-complete","status":"resolved","id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)$ (m-complete, see [[92-df-m-complete]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-creative-set","status":"resolved","id":"c9d6396579de4ff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Creative}$ (creative-set predicate, see [[92-df-creative-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MComplete}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Creative}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}m\\text{-}complete\\text{-}creative} \\vdash \\mathrm{MComplete}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Creative}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-refl